{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t選委會界別分組一般選舉今日共接獲5份提名表格，分別是3份候選人提名表格及兩份指定團體提名表格。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n候選人提名表格來自酒店界及工業界，團體提名表格則全部來自內地港人團體的代表。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n提名期自上周三開始，至本月20日結束，至今累計共接獲1115份候選人提名表格，及40份指定團體提名表格。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：陳樂謙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T12:39:54.565950+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T12:23:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T23:37:58.761254+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T12:37:41.506804+00:00","content_hash":"61958f30a60efcd4d1d9f5a27bd088ca870c252d663d018cc99baa0f79e334ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}